/// known-gap: interp stash_count is VM-only (unknown action)
/// Work done inside an action called by name (invoke, summon, callbacks)
/// is collected as it runs, so memory does not pile up there.
act churn(n)
    i | 0
    while i < n
        tmp | [i, i + 1]
        i |= i + 1
    xx
    return :stash_count(){"total"}
xx
total | :invoke("churn", 400000)
say(total < 200000)
